/rmms55MpLdBWRDX8LLDTctgXUuA.jpg"},{"n":"Eric Dane","c":"Nathan Blythe","f":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4PsLKBKN4e0zRT2oS4BjE8Xu1un.jpg"},{"n":"Violett Beane","c":"Evan Shepherd","f":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5jalFEkEpbNxjc3HMsEYT0vQxSr.jpg"},{"n":"Uli Latukefu","c":"Lucas Finau","f":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/m0wqEqbNrWkZ5vh6EZKliu86wgY.jpg"},{"n":"Elliot Knight","c":"Keyonte Bell","f":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1vko3mHyqLSkabnhHO99sZTDl8t.jpg"}],"crew":"Creador: Derek Haas","recs":["The Closer","Ley y orden: Los Ángeles","Nuevos policías","New York Undercover","Ballard"],"tr":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t72R6wZ0zQ8"},{"t":"The Gentlemen: La serie","ov":"Cuando Eddie hereda la finca de su aristocrática familia, descubre que alberga una enorme plantación de marihuana... y que sus propietarios no piensan marcharse.","b":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yG1wltFmkX5c5ocACKfpX0tp3SY.jpg","u":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/236235","cast":[{"n":"Theo James (Eddie Horniman"},{"n":"Duke of Halstead)"},{"n":"Kaya Scodelario","c":"Susie Glass"},{"n":"Daniel Ings","c":"Freddy Horniman"},{"n":"Joely Richardson","c":"Lady Sabrina Horniman"},{"n":"Vinnie Jones","c":"Geoff Seacombe"},{"n":"Giancarlo Esposito","c":"Uncle Stan"}],"crew":"Creador: Guy Ritchie","recs":["Sneaky Pete","Average Joe","Brassic","Interior Chinatown","The Outlaws"],"tr":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wyEOwHrpZH4"},{"t":"Neagley","ov":"Llega un nuevo capítulo del universo de REACHER. Frances Neagley, investigadora privada en Chicago y antigua compañera militar de Jack Reacher en la Unidad de Investigaciones Especiales 110 del Ejército, emprende una implacable búsqueda de justicia cuando descubre que un amigo muy querido del pasado ha muerto en un sospechoso accidente.","b":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uYOYLFQ4q7asuhdiKXCqGaeAQUH.jpg","u":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/273207","cast":[{"n":"Maria Sten","c":"Frances Neagley","f":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7QlPWbZ